---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="what adrianlumley.co collects, why, and who handles it.">
  <PageIntro title="privacy" standfirst="short version: almost nothing, and none of it is sold." />

  <div class="content-stack measure">
    <p>last updated: november 2026.</p>

    <h2 class="label">analytics</h2>
    <p>this site uses umami and cloudflare web analytics to count page views. both are cookieless. they record things like the page visited, the referring site, browser type, and rough country. they don't identify you personally and i don't use them to follow you across other sites.</p>

    <h2 class="label">the contact form</h2>
    <p>if you use the contact form, your name, email address, and message are sent to me through formspree, which delivers them to my inbox. i use them only to reply. i don't add you to a mailing list and don't share your message with anyone else.</p>

    <h2 class="label">hosting</h2>
    <p>the site is served by cloudflare, which processes standard request data (such as ip address) to deliver pages and protect against abuse.</p>

    <h2 class="label">the lab tools</h2>
    <p>the small tools under /lab/ run in your browser. anything you type into them stays on your device unless a tool says otherwise.</p>

    <h2 class="label">your choices</h2>
    <p>you can ask me to delete anything you've sent through the contact form. use the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> and i'll take care of it.</p>

    <h2 class="label">changes</h2>
    <p>if this changes, i'll update this page and the date above.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
